+   * `L: lcall far [DGROUP:0x40a]; jae/jb`: `jb L_ret` returns when the frame poll FUN_1000_35a7 sets
+   * CF=1, else `test ax,[dd6a]; je L` loops while (poll_ax & mask)==0.  Ghidra dropped the x86 CF
+   * (uninit `in_CF` -> the CF=1 early-return never fires), so on the empty-queue intro path (poll ax=0)
+   * the loop spun forever.  Thread the poll CF via g_fist_cf (set by FUN_1000_35a7, patch 073). */
